  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: the filed probes are still safe ((a) ddg reached; (b) now blocked source_not_tracked, not source_undefined). A third shape reproduces an unearned refutation: Go s := []string{\"\"}; t := s; t[0] = os.Getenv(\"API_KEY\"); fmt.Println(len(t)); os.WriteFile(..., []byte(s[0]), ...) gives verdict confirmed with no claim caveat; footer 'Flows REMOVED by the walk this run: 1'. Control writing t[0] gives violated ddg reached. This is inside ADR-0017 §7b / WI-kabif's owned alias trade; owner to rule defect vs disclosed limit. MECHANISM: no alias model: the walk exhausts along the written alias and §3a removal deletes a flow that reaches the sink through the other name; textual L4 cannot see it. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-jahip,WI-kabif,INV-lupav."  # 3c16
