  message: "PRIORITY P3 -> P2 (owner-approved 2026-11-01). Reason: a false clean. The Go slice-alias write (s := []string{\"\"}; t := s; t[0] = os.Getenv(\"API_KEY\"); os.WriteFile(..., []byte(s[0]), ...)) is walk-refuted and removed, so verify-claims reports confirmed with no claim caveat (footer 'Flows REMOVED by the walk this run: 1'); the t[0] control gives violated. Whether to fix it or disclose it as an ADR-0017 §7b / WI-kabif alias limit is still open."  # 43c9
